  <section class="frame-sources" id="sources">
    <div><p class="frame-kicker">SOURCE NOTES</p><h2 class="display">Draft status stays visible.</h2><p>The frame platform design lives in the <code>beadhive/frame</code> repo and is design only: it asserts no shipping adapters, schemas or commands and authorises no allocation, credential injection, live enrollment or production dispatch. What ships in <code>bh</code> — membership, heartbeats, admission, lifecycle, eligibility, HQ modes, placement — is documented in the fleet-membership and HQ guides. Use the design as the topology source, not the older onboarding diagrams.</p></div>
